    "summary": "For a **HAEMONCULUS** model. In your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), once per battle, you may activate this Enhancement for the bearer and may also spend 1 Pain token. After that:\n\n- Every enemy unit no more than 12″ from the bearer takes a [Battle-shock test](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock), at -1 if you spent the token.\n- Each **PSYKER** unit that fails that test suffers 3 **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)**.",
